      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To generate a short visual description for an image, I need to use a concrete external provider. I will use Amazon Rekognition, which is a service that makes it easy to add image and video analysis to applications. I will import the necessary module from the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use the Rekognition client to call the appropriate API. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789889869616,
          "start": 1789889867400
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bdbfee88001mZD6D3uDsW6Hb0",
