      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the detect_image_labels.py file, I need to use a concrete external provider for image label detection. Google Cloud Vision API is a suitable choice for this task. I will import the necessary client library and use the Vision API to detect labels in a static image. The provider will be identifiable through the import statement and the client initialization. </thinking>\n",
